Parakeet Ultra was created by Moondream (M87 Labs, Inc.):
https://huggingface.co/moondream/parakeet-ultra (commit 73175eb7aeb0d82f1e2a6b53b3aabc10a90bcd0b).
It is a post-trained version of NVIDIA's parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3:
https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3 (commit 541d1f99c6b0c3cd0b11a95167540bb8edefd82b).
No copyright notice is supplied with either model.

License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
The full legal code is in LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt.

Modified. Moondream post-trained NVIDIA's model. For these files,
Moondream's weights were converted to ONNX for sherpa-onnx:
  - NVIDIA's v3 checkpoint supplied the model graph, the preprocessor
    (including the mel filterbank and window) and the tokenizer. All of
    its learned weights were replaced with Moondream's.
  - Only the transducer (encoder, decoder, joiner) was exported. The
    voice-activity head in Moondream's checkpoint (the vad_head tensors)
    was dropped.
  - The weights were quantized to int8 with ONNX Runtime.
  - parakeet-ultra-tokens.txt is the v3 tokenizer's vocabulary, unchanged.
The conversion involved no retraining or fine-tuning.

Provided as-is, without warranties of any kind. See Section 5 of the
license.

